---
description: JavaScript and TypeScript project gateway. Detect project capabilities before changes and load only relevant shared JS/TS rules.
alwaysApply: true
---

Before any JavaScript or TypeScript task, read `.ai-rules/js-ts/01-AI通用入口规则.md`.

Use `.ai-rules/js-ts/00-文档总览.md` to select only the topic rules needed for the task.

- Inspect package.json, lockfiles, workspace, scripts, runtime/package-manager constraints, tsconfig, installed dependencies, nearby code, tests, build, and deployment configuration before choosing APIs or commands.
- Do not assume a runtime, framework, dependency, environment variable, API, DOM structure, test command, image tag, or architecture not present in the project.
- Do not upgrade runtimes/dependencies, migrate frameworks, build systems, state/style systems, or infrastructure, or perform unrelated refactors without explicit user authorization.
- Report changes, validation performed, unverified work, and remaining risks.
